{
  "id": "MRK.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Marko 8",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kuwijisha wandu elfu inya vindo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku ghaja, iji izungu ja wandu jerekoghe ibaa sena, nawo wikasowa kindo chingi cheja, Jesu ukawiwanga wanughi wake, ukaghamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nawadwa ni wughoma ghwa wandu disindanye matuku adadu, nawo ndewiwadie kindo chingi cheja anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani ngawizera wighale mzawo na njala, wichadumbukia chienyi, angu wamu wawo wafuma kula koni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanughi wake wikamtumbulia, “Welee, idimika wada mundu kuwighudisha wandu awa na mikate aha kireti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukawikotia, “Moko na mikate ilinga?” Wikamzera, “Mfungade.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukafunya momu wandu wisee kidombo andonyi. Ukaiwusa ija mikate mfungade, hata umeria kufunya chawucha, ukaichukanya, ukawineka wanughi wake wiiwaghie wandu, nawo wikawiwaghia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo werekoghe na samaki ndinieri, naro umeria kurirasimia, ukafunya momu na iro wori rineko wandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wikaja, wikaghuda. Wikatumbanya masighariko, wikachura vikapu mfungade. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo werekoghe sa elfu inya. Nao ukawizera wighale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahoeni, ukangia ishuonyi andwamweri na wanughi wake, wikaghenda isanga ja Dalmanutha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mafarisayo kulola alama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mafarisayo wikacha kwa Jesu, wikazoya kubonya nganyi nao; wikalola alama kwake kufuma mlungunyi, wikimtima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 12.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 11.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukasoria ngolo na ndighi, ukaghamba, “Welee, kwaki kivalwa ichi chilolagha alama? Namghoria loli, kivalwa ichi ndechichanekwa alama ingi anduangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 12.39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 11.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawisigha, ukangia ishuonyi sena, ukazoya kuruwuka cha kimonu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chachu ya Mafarisayo na ya Herode",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana wanughi wereliwieghe kudwa mikate, na aja ishuonyi, wedesighwa na mkate ghumweri tu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukawilaghira ukighamba, “Zighanenyi mkulindie na chachu ya Mafarisayo na ya Herode.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 12.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikatumbuliana weni na weni wikighamba, “Ni iji disewadie mikate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukimanya agho ukawizera, “Welee, kwaki mwaririkanya gha kusowa mikate? Hata na iji ndemmbonagha, hata ndemtambukilwagha? Ngolo renyu raduagha rikurie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meso mwawadie ela ndemmbonagha, na madu mwawadie ela ndemsikiragha, hata ndemkumbukagha?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 5.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 12.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 4.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji nereichikanyireghe ija mikate misanu kwa wandu elfu isanu, moretumbanyireghe vikapu vilinga vichue masighariko gha ija mikate erechikanyiroghe?” Wikatumbulia, “Ikumi na viwi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na ija mikate mfungade kwa wandu elfu inya, moretumbanyireghe vikapu vilinga vichue masighariko gha ija mikate erechikanyiroghe?” Wikatumbulia, “Mfungade.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawizera, “Hata na iji ndemtambukilwagha?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kuboisa mundu ufue meso Bethsaida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Jesu na wanughi wake wikacha Bethsaida. Wandu wamu wikamredia mundu ufue meso, wikamlomba umuadade. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukammbwadia mkonu uja mundu ufue meso, ukamreda shighadi ya muzi. Ukamchuya mada mesonyi kwake, ukammbikiria mikonu, ukamkotia, “Welee, kwawuyawona kindo chingi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukazighana noko, ukaghamba, “Nawona wandu, ela waawuyawoneka sa midi ighendagha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ukammbikiria mikonu indo ja kawi mesonyi kwake, ukazighana na ndighi, ukaboa; nao ukawona vilambo vose nicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukamlaghira ughale ukighamba, “Kusakewuya mzinyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wushuhuda ghwa Petro aighu ya Jesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukafuma na wanughi wake, wikangia mizi ya Kaisaria Filipi. Chienyi, ukawikotia wanughi wake, “Welee, wandu waghambagha ini nani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikamtumbulia, “Wamu wadaghamba oho ko Johane M'baputizi, wazima Elija, na wazima umu wa walodi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.14+MRK.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 6.14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.7+LUK.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 9.7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawikotia, “Ela inyo mwaghambagha ini nani?” Petro ukatumbulia, “Oho ko Kristo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.6.68+JHN.6.69"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh. 6.68-69",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawilaghira nandighi wisakemghoria mndungi malagho ghake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kughora aighu ya matiriro, na kifwa chake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukazoya kuwifundisha wanughi wake: “Mwana wa Mdamu suti utiriro maza nyingi, na kuleghwa ni waghosi na wakohani wabaa, na walimu wa Sharia, sena ubwagho, na nyuma ya matuku adadu ucharuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawighoria ilagho iji worinyi, Petro ukamruda kambai, ukazoya kumkemia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukaghaluka, ukawizighana wanughi wake ukamkemia Petro ukighamba, “Injika noko, Shetani! Angu oho ndekuririkanyagha maza ra Mlungu anduangi, ela ra wandu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukajiwanga jija izungu andwamweri na wanughi wake wimchee, ukawizera, “Ngera mundu wakunda kuninugha, ukukane uo moni, ughuduke msalaba ghwake, uninughe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 10.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 14.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu uo ose uchaakunda kujikira irangi jake, uchajilaghasha; ela uo ose uchaajilaghasha irangi jake kwa wundu ghwapo, na kwa wundu ghwa ijo Ilagho Jiboie, nuo moni uchaajikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 10.39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 17.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh. 12.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ichamfwana mundu kii ukaghupata wurumwengu ghose, sena ulaghashe irangi jake? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu mundu uchafunya kindoki kuindana na irangi jake? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu uo uchaaniwonia waya ini na malagho ghapo, kwa kivalwa ichi cha kulaka na kaung'a, Mwana wa Mdamu wori uchammbonia waya, kasikira wacha na wubaa ghwa ndee, andwamweri na weke malaika wielie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
